{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_09",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ff161f4c5e88dfb1e965d53e87a041656b07ebe8aae109dd0143c81f80ebfb70",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d519c569d2b5bb0ab48ab57449795439d7bb61fe58c284439890d170cfb4d52a",
      "text": "炽热而冷静燃烧的男儿们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf5d9a164650e58222944ad82311a40993c6c5d44c44a344c595a5644b4f766c",
      "text": "JIF正式演出的前一天。抵达会场的神速一魂，\n被未曾习惯的宽广会场和氛围所震慑。但在\n彩排过程中逐渐找回了平时的步调。他们下定决心\n要让观众大吃一惊，做好了迎接明日舞台的准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000043:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d811f7563c90e10ce6c36d183b8417e0e4362c281ceb20eccb2636b4f5ab7ada",
      "text": "第9话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000043:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d519c569d2b5bb0ab48ab57449795439d7bb61fe58c284439890d170cfb4d52a",
      "text": "炽热而冷静燃烧的男儿们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000053:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cb2d3984a587b414c9c256216f0444ab06650ebb86f47ac8e0c8b924537b549",
      "text": "巴士车内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cae3bee68f7d9db41f07774314e65deefa6eb94b854bcdd7347ad35b160c6f2",
      "text": "（终于明天就是“JAPAN IDOL FES”的正式演出了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60c617349dc3b44a558612f04723c7675b3c1eb54b5e5355a2f9aa8345ad14e",
      "text": "（虽然也有人感到紧张，\n但大家似乎都很期待）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0f9121b674ae01149b344f1169f08a53f01418ae19164374fbbdb52fa79e5d",
      "text": "喂，玄武。\n到了会场之后，就要立刻开始彩排了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c92c815d2f3fb7453705d5a886bec777bb887f330ae0a4abdb1f4ed61bf440f",
      "text": "啊啊。然后只要完成明天的带妆彩排……\n总算就真要迎来正式演出了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a313846fb1bfc526fb7e3c369e7d4db307a2f5fd178f3a8a6fc6173cf6d4c79e",
      "text": "咕～燃起来啦～！\n就保持这股气势，一口气冲到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64dacd25beafac2b871fddcd6674603332670a95b92b4ed334d52904a25bae28",
      "text": "意气轩昂。虽然日程排得很满，\n但我也要向朱雀看齐，全力以赴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e48b1a3fcba7a1e36f9c2c52feeb0af596786d6fbada8ebe1c12b77216440064",
      "text": "（就像以往一样，舞台一定会成功的！\n收到这封信的时候，大家的高兴劲也非同寻常）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e655b8f2d7b41f1797bbe02747b05c9f8812843cd5ef19fd55ac399eaf761d0d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n您又在读JIF寄来的信了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7e77e625913e06e350845fff87910e6b22eba1d5f4ffb777bd6848fbfc0211",
      "text": "嗯。“投票第1名，获得2名赞助商推荐，\n确定出演——315 Production”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabeac449352019d5c5a4f0ae075565556e2ea5a350e4789afa7df1a58010cdd",
      "text": "无论重读多少次，都会感到热血沸腾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec2c5d7c88f1b922d73b020961cdfe2df61c01fd61232f124109595c5862f9a",
      "text": "靠各位偶像与制作人的力量\n争取来的出演资格……我也感慨万千！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:def0c24d83b1e0eccef96976e9a4affcd0879c3f8c3d1810702811eaa4ca2df1",
      "text": "喂喂你们两个啊，\n现在就感动还太早啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:114b7f60016a28b11411b200f27a864b3a12c640c3830cfd11f7c60d5ff6c353",
      "text": "哼，朱雀说得对。\n好戏才刚要开场呢，番长、贤哥。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:650fab218d90dee8185f59792fea2cfc3ab6ea8966034e5fb47213498377eeb2",
      "text": "朱雀先生、玄武先生……！\n好的，一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000063:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "几个月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d3b6bbbeeea5d1fde0d608e76d2173bbe068ebc870f8d2e8a27efb80323d93",
      "text": "哦，玄武！你已经到了啊。\n……话说，来了好多人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef834d8da77102612287623ad7cae49578631b9f9613ac2aee3047f8c3e865f2",
      "text": "啊啊。听说番长有重要的事情要宣布……\n朱雀，你听说具体内容了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be1dbc36062104e988b6d16bc15d82bd4b299bd9722278a5e725ceacb62d1f05",
      "text": "没。我什么都没听说……但这里的气氛，\n总觉得非同小可啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d886b6ef953fb0e0922e15539704eb9d23c066218b20bbbd79c93fe0948fa57",
      "text": "肯定有我们想象不到的重大发表！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9074b308c53739353e812d9294875b2bcff683968c8862599cd572d0ae52e6f5",
      "text": "既然是番长，肯定是个好消息吧。\n……噢，说曹操曹操到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b235794b2ec6c430982466f5716289f17eeff8331bfa62c6918967cd47e62db3",
      "text": "大家辛苦了！百忙之中抽空\n集合，非常感谢各位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1e9c7adc96a7ab37475c790d5b7b867bf6cab9ea4a725737ecdd76c6f532390",
      "text": "今天有一件重要的事要通知大家。\n这次，在日本最大规模的偶像音乐节……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdd1070f97898a63d9db3034b6fd2b2890c69a7f98b226188e558e410ccafc50",
      "text": "“JAPAN IDOL FES”上，\n315 Production确定出演了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46dfb3b1b5535e8d732297a64fc112f5215b60955171204a4f07fd6c59e22776",
      "text": "恭喜各位！接下来的\n详细情况，就由我来向大家说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a93bf41752aa2bc8e1488bba61df4d81406072155c3ff734848f6636bbf075b",
      "text": "JIF……！一直以此为目标的舞台啊。\n喂玄武，我们真的能登台了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34c113915d88d9a48e0acc1a28852237f1377d008d2d97ab6004878f162ceda9",
      "text": "啊啊！力战奋斗。就让音乐节的观众见识一下\n神速一魂的气魄与狠劲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000216:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000224:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e24c02aad73a06af0b735ea13d605e65fb6197b97f5768d208833f1ce3583c14",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，晚上好。\n那个，对不起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000226:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:298ddd5f2e9267a00e254c27b0b1216f45fe6cd365529d1c1579c7c5ecc7daab",
      "text": "自从听说要参加JIF之后，\n我心里就一直扑通扑通跳个不停，完全睡不着觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000228:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a419a9764bdfeafdb69080cde2eb7746b32291e7185a8d14f9df2e1abfbfe46",
      "text": "所以，就忍不住打电话过来了。\n能够参加JIF，感觉就像做梦一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000230:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2353fd85c93cbef03e301d350ec5af1d7e10e617bff0633d6051d4de2af5ef1d",
      "text": "这不是做梦哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000231:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:114bac03bf9fdd9a5892df5e61ffd8bb35037e3ef9e8b2d94c32729397409259",
      "text": "其实这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000233:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b355644626879d25f5afb0cdb2db775b550f5e2727de0fb3de05c59284237b66",
      "text": "是、是的……！这不是做梦，\n是真的要和大家一起站上那么大的舞台呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000237:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be251041663ea9d36cfe21e8c7127b8cdc8baf7b6665b794700f9453e43a80e1",
      "text": "诶……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000239:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c24ef3e8ebdf9d88481b78378ceb9e6b74e99f2327ca1ae4f3e223373d34051c",
      "text": "这不是做梦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000242:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b355644626879d25f5afb0cdb2db775b550f5e2727de0fb3de05c59284237b66",
      "text": "是、是的……！这不是做梦，\n是真的要和大家一起站上那么大的舞台呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000246:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b185aa959bff1f8534717d0034d92f57f02b6ef39dd7a03c20c0c29da188af04",
      "text": "这是直央君和大家\n努力的成果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000249:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:630dc6405889b843c06bf1f1536dbeee21772a1d2812b03972f4b82e86543065",
      "text": "谢谢您，制作人！\n我从明天开始会更加努力练习的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000251:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e29e508d2228c4c662e445212055c5bac4468b6ebad2536338b343adfec006",
      "text": "到了当天，我想向支持我们的\n粉丝们好好道谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000253:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e23298695934fe1c7a33edf2026647f69b0923cb6a6c1f4df828b5bac6ff3335",
      "text": "一起\n加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000254:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de607b8ff15dcaa975d2a0021b81d7bf57eb9083759f1843f9556f2934600118",
      "text": "大家一起\n向他们好好道谢吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000257:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0826f4d0dc85c609a60020cb2196fb5d12fd74df02d4306dd742e4d10432d0f",
      "text": "好的。……诶嘿嘿，和制作人聊着聊着，\n心跳就平复下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000259:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bbcfcbe9b7fba943b154b01ddfeb89512485fbdd8ca4eba37b944149ec8cd18",
      "text": "感觉能睡得着了。\n谢谢您听我说了这么多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_b:cmd-000261:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ab9f67575fab977e13ce65f0fe4be8d9ea156842267b4b8a0eff5d58e4b1dc8",
      "text": "那么制作人，晚安。\n明天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39a5a1100ad82194894f93db1aec7479cc5d85f757704ab7e827396ea9d76c9e",
      "text": "早上好，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n事不宜迟，我们开始JIF的商讨吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea91dd0e2c8bc028affea0ec600d093c3fb98f91a41d0e6f9bc1e2cbacda180c",
      "text": "好的！那么首先，\n容我再次向两位说明一下JIF。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c1dfd286e337edb94bdb886c74aab1aa39d6c8a08086e19a1783277a7fd657",
      "text": "这场音乐节将在容纳人数前所未有的超大场地\n举办，并面向全世界进行网络直播。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c367a81e604e800b4d1b9cf03842f4dc0e35e3ca19c490266c678b46e0361b7",
      "text": "也就是说全世界都能看到啊……\n重新听你这么一说，还真是不得了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48ac8884fad2b445d2a0de4a9765b1cc8f5e8fd6a70259836a7dba07bd8b1c3a",
      "text": "是的。而且还有来自众多知名事务所的\n形形色色的偶像出演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2195ed8d5bed3ffc9069a77e307fbe44cb7d15e8b5b43d718a9106e2730cd2b1",
      "text": "换言之，会场里也会有大量完全不了解\n315 Production的观众。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118d39bb4e39613b0abcab815e4cd8ebe932d5e79915566e17ec0f4f6382b2cc",
      "text": "倒不如说，不熟悉315 Pro的\n观众应该占绝大多数吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa935e2302e4033608e9798b102ade73db81fb25c5de91c66296cc54028618e7",
      "text": "这么说，也就是说……这就是踢馆对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d337dacee703663ad08a78a5c46345d1b99c63678148b7755295736dfd41ec79",
      "text": "没想到居然会以偶像的身份，\n去踢馆啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfefcf5fc45bee83c5aa7d7e6da0f52677dc3cb072e409bd6adf01d9984f38bc",
      "text": "啊啊，燃起来了。就用我们的舞台，\n让全场观众目瞪口呆吧，朱雀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:587494960143abf5e636f151ea72c3d64cdd4c0856b5b2aaa5c6e9a8b278f240",
      "text": "噢！燃起来了，Burning！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a38c7b25102b54bfc759cee7d888e7b8e8d5e130dc54ea8ff52c68a44ff7e55f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，喵子也干劲十足啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe32dd3895e3ae323326a58b491199e49e5e46ebbafd0e49f5bddbf4b0b1d8ae",
      "text": "有朱雀先生、玄武先生和喵子的力量，\n一定能点燃全场的气氛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a285507beb94c30bf862f3bb044688b52776cc318b1955aa1e812b65c9f3bb7c",
      "text": "而且，所有观众\n都会成为神速一魂的粉丝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a12ba88e346594b0e01f4fa18946014a59e59cc79358bc6f230efe97978ebdd",
      "text": "多谢啦，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n最好的结果就由我们来拿给你看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000124:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15557e5d87c9be06ef6ffdb60be1899a66677cb7506533ee50b03f0bf8f20703",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！\n抱歉啊，突然打电话过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000135:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d343ca896cf656862d861688fd5198331ffd14c267246db044a087c376951e73",
      "text": "没事的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000137:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc34bf7e22104db3534195221f2a68eea01f2b4f2b02f7e2b08395e11c26056e",
      "text": "其实，自从公布了JIF的出演者名单之后，\n我们学校就炸开锅了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000139:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e005760814e36e0534f7986870e5a6af5fc9141d97d786837bba3e7a6b6fca4",
      "text": "学校的老师和大家，\n都说要为我们提供协助呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdc0b2903504543bdd7e0cb788c6f51daf50a274429c5c3ef5c590b99080d6e5",
      "text": "现在隼人和旬正去打听\n详细情况……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b16bead75cf43950b72bc10eefc07d7307444a1624297d7f7f26132112a3b342",
      "text": "总之我想着最好先跟制作人说一声，\n就代表大家打电话过来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000145:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c15553e7d232d02afa790f2b77c43c33b3c03663714681ed6cc0b513f9e8006d",
      "text": "那可真厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000146:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1721f0ad530b6dfeac062163ff8503fed5d72fa317f9102e86561c104c1eb49a",
      "text": "那可真是个\n令人高兴的好消息！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a9f2f3111e9695c13b213090cd0c48f5da6744328be5943dc7293d5b9608b70",
      "text": "嗯，大家这么支持我们，\n我超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000151:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50939f2c8b0b1d4e0fd84b1dcee85f52777aaf94ddc62a47da21d99539a93eff",
      "text": "等弄清楚具体是怎么回事之后，\n我再联系你。拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_c:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9c2b15e9a26822af5e9e9dde874562c9ea523b2d26fb0030b485bc0a038d4b6",
      "text": "……我说，●●●●プロデューサー。JIF，\n我们一定要让它大获成功啊！……嘿嘿，那就先这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2db1101e862fa663edd8f0e34c1fd06be6e7beba884338dca1623b61e17ac0d",
      "text": "彩排开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922bbd02fcf261d9a766caceaf8aacad8bae267a495066c77e50b3f35bdad0c2",
      "text": "喔喔……比听说过的还要宽阔的会场啊……\n天花板好高，观众席的数量也完全不是一个量级的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53c55a4854d2fd4d500f2b9b861923cde3081de776cf180820532c79b1f78bd8",
      "text": "实际站在舞台上，真切体会到了规模的庞大啊。\n要记住的事情太多了，这可不轻松啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec4c6dccc52e1b6d1fb13c9e59f072ab9223df86829b8cfebedb52e7fd7fb967",
      "text": "喵——！喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1280126bfac99312ed44220edd1baa97573701d1622d23c2625a6cd6839a5b1c",
      "text": "喵、喵子，好兴奋啊。是被吓到了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddfdcf6b7bbf3bc3fad4ea4db910972b8b57455793cb4c99d2e9680f6969c57e",
      "text": "……先开始彩排吧。\n就按照一直以来的练习那样来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000074:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:868a50a3c1453fe44b8ff4a64290b427c5fca4bb424459b64b3922e88885a75a",
      "text": "彩排结束……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb997b481ebb9e2122862d8b9d0a115565ce8a17ee74404b09a2a19dcb5f23ac",
      "text": "呼～～！尽情活动了一下身子之后，\n总算习惯这氛围了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26428de6cdba4bf76891f8cdf158bb5c4ee2f17a0892306eb6dcfde866656327",
      "text": "啊啊。不过……看呐，Jupiter的三人。\n无论换到什么场地，对他们而言似乎都不成问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf496aee8cfd7c8903674efa1e859eee78d7a8a0951e532701af63517f1fd81",
      "text": "玄武也这么觉得吗。完成度甚至超越了\n平时的练习……！太厉害了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef7586f2ebcaac8b68546aa4c9c8c759e1983aea3aa6fbffcd84aa9f908b554d",
      "text": "毕竟Jupiter做偶像的时间比我们长嘛。\n比我们做得更好也是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b5e5dcbe32c2681f2286f7b4795ec795f483f0eb25ef213ffdb756d78d103b",
      "text": "但是……不仅如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:410073fc9d002d93f126bd01a7bfba81451ce2db9cb413a35fcf61e089c9f94e",
      "text": "是啊。在我们满足于练了10遍、20遍的时候，\nJupiter已经练了1000遍、10000遍了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56aba6301b5716f82e8fb77be3179ae1bef8a867115c7f5f5ece6ebba2858dd9",
      "text": "三人的舞步、歌声，都是这么体现出来的。\n……正因如此，才更不能认输！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ddb75707bb51907fbfa7195137ebaa2d262374723dc602f5a659a4043d736d3",
      "text": "要是Jupiter练了10000遍，我们就要练它的两倍。\n练个100万遍给他们看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:573f61a0baee5a216f9a8d17f5c358904efd75e949a8aa113ecc84ed5f20663e",
      "text": "……呵，说得对。\n我也在想同一件事呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0e7fe6ae19f0581fa920648c9007bdf2075c9f926c30aef1d557c2a9270219",
      "text": "就让我们不顾一切地全力奔驰到底吧。\n区区100万遍，对我们来说眨眼就过了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf6eb6471f7cd535587f38215da9a3f9aeba6f81e9f91ecae9d0ee562725608d",
      "text": "咕～～当偶像果然太燃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcb810bf295dfdfe0b4827775679f70f72d0a99ec6117f3b7595e5f6b93e41b4",
      "text": "……神速一魂那两人，还在练吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b376288bef27369ec2f07b8db937992504ca4388b0e15e9fcc778086278897e",
      "text": "嗯。明明彩排都结束了，还一直在自主练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23d15b87e340330e898635fe716cb41e99d347935d360c4d752081c7db479bfd",
      "text": "啊——我摆前辈架子装帅气，\n都开始觉得累了啦～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1c5be05620ba8ab0c84a0b78c9ba3d671c3ad2dd279924b8d047f563e68b37",
      "text": "呵呵。嘴上这么说，\n翔太其实也完全没有要停下的意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce39afeea7c188210fcacfcc6d413d093514ac40c09e62da332cbc930e89596",
      "text": "翔太和北斗心里也明白的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d05db0a326ddb7ad21171fc094909c00ed6cad98bb81c35a826ec4413edc3b",
      "text": "既然站在同一个舞台上，对手就不单单是他事务所的\n偶像。315 Pro的同伴也一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82684e37432b14550874c2dd9003289b870aed743a83819e9b875dbd58dcd449",
      "text": "哪怕是315 Pro里数一数二热血的组合……\n那个神速一魂，我们也要超越他们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9844f492635abc8f7653c7d76790062015ff1329d27de494c2a0fe328650c58",
      "text": "所以我才讨厌热血笨蛋嘛——。\n动不动就跟身边的人杠上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61daaa4b7e3922ba611dd4c8be27a2fd7890bd11c1975a1448f929d98d02341e",
      "text": "这才是冬马嘛。“热血”这个词，\n不就是为了冬马而存在的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ec7106778ae7e43debfd3343231ea0bff0916db1df13ca739c0879bff11803e",
      "text": "话是这么说，你们两个不也\n一直陪我练到现在吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebff8d0cc260dd732ab0a4c8253c47574e8dc02f2da1c9eb225e0f0c37db1301",
      "text": "嘿嘿……当偶像果然太燃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eeec03d147cdb725c3ec25f0169083c0922b2e0b4e66180bce75312054ab9aa",
      "text": "北斗、翔太。明天一定要让大家\n看到最棒的Jupiter！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_f:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0c696bb5fe9ed2ee2f773176791b408b8e59a341ea561cc88486294fae8377",
      "text": "……接下来只要迎接明天的带妆彩排和正式演出就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66b14b86b428cd886e1b31cdb925cb9033b4e31a761b2a2932b62d2c3dc85849",
      "text": "明天的彩排还有其他事务所的偶像在，\n所以会比今天更……话说，翔太。你怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3affba85a7738ea08fd5b4d1db1e26260b123443e3791be0b2edcf7d69a63174",
      "text": "一想到工作人员们到现在还在为了明天而努力，\n就有点感触呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6c863f07389cb1a572116ca293e3df8c621306dd18058e5f70cccc28ebe033",
      "text": "因为听说他们今天还要核对到很晚嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7f22b17739791190d1a050ef4ae591c3343a5a36becdf3afc11fabcbbe01d22",
      "text": "说得也是呢……为了让明天的JIF成功而付出\n努力的，并不只有我们偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a59b5f670257e08a045f5b527c482995ab1a0e9988066321155c2e3aeb86ac",
      "text": "工作人员也和我们是一样的。\n在彩排期间，我也强烈地感受到了这一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecfa2ab8cc79fcc09e66d618300bd67addfb5fec78aeac845bf77ffec73613f1",
      "text": "明明正式演出是明天，看了我们的彩排后，\n他们还针对灯光和演出提出了各种各样的建议呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4688d92134b63c0dabd9d91024c9106e5fe92d80e159db1951b9788c92672564",
      "text": "那真是帮了大忙了。我们背负的不单单是\n粉丝和事务所的期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_g:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7767e22d98a36266678cf9e59ae14d3a25453ce0d77034d3b825707f1458d6d",
      "text": "还有所有参与这场音乐节的人们，\n想要让它成功的那份心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fcbf6d522870c2b347c9c313539aad95fef7bbf3f773fcbd6f11f48a20311e2",
      "text": "……嘛，不仅是我们三个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:418a603a7b36b5e4b4cce9c1e189312f53254d0ac26f0c74b9932a81775438e3",
      "text": "只要和315 Pro的大家在一起，回应满场的期待\n根本易如反掌就是了♪对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13f0000525e238b9e08b894fd63d2a8c7f4db7854ac4e1ea366634abfa751b59",
      "text": "是啊。\n看了今天的彩排，我也深信不疑了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959fc9e0d84433a5335971eabf0f3942f92c8c01c7caf5d282a7549bb1b6b496",
      "text": "明天一定要让会场里的所有人，\n见识到我们315 Pro有多厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90bcbcb42f0af73b5da66dbff71fa5ec52828b819f6ea49932594c6dd764901c",
      "text": "呵呵。那么为了迎接明天的正式演出，今天早点休息吧。\n明天早上也起得很早呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:844a0e567e468914528f8d503e86b6dc01ffe38ec7fbb9db30d4878536857056",
      "text": "啊～对了！你们两个，明天一定要好好\n叫我起床哦！早上我可是很难伺候的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00c57a6889877c3c4c72ac710c46ccc9b25a17d709beab778536de9d1f283e46",
      "text": "亏你自己好意思说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:859809bd111fbe23cb82cb4141215067e5e4bb8fe9ef5e321d233ebfe795083f",
      "text": "话虽如此，我倒是不担心。只要跟工作扯上关系，\n翔太都会乖乖爬起来的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373890f2679eaa71a143151e17340f6c1c696c501dc2921e1d2c54adf1b13367",
      "text": "谁知道呢……总之。今天好好休息，\n明天以最佳状态站上舞台！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000123:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c8e8d2ef07c1035749daf730b98833297fdd5da2933d2642c23e776b7acd35",
      "text": "酒店房间内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30cfc4131a6b6c1034ca53ed1f56b618a4eccfeef12b4d17d4d2e92138ee7c89",
      "text": "制作人，\n谢谢你",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92bb4e5c42430cdc96152ca652121c6846064b72e58deca0a9788918bd920b2b",
      "text": "特意安排了喵子能住的酒店，\n帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000134:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfc48a77291ee72af0571a34e387bf6a9c972b568328cfffab8eba200cfb428",
      "text": "不要紧吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000134:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0a9d540eb5f49f10c11f3703e89d85804d9e134745e2e1f41003a7109bb519a",
      "text": "玄武先生和喵子同一间房间\n没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000135:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae00d4c10263421a539d50a457d408e9e8fc51c34617c5b10a0dcfad1b4dd036",
      "text": "太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000135:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:831994b5b91920f4373c000582a1ae1719fbddd9873a4bdfb09b1e90e1444061",
      "text": "能有喵子可以入住的酒店\n真是太好了。\n玄武先生不要紧吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000139:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f4680ac28cfc35dba6c847fa686af7cbc9320712e3bf2a6ec75b06a1370fe7c",
      "text": "啊啊，不用担心。\n我的猫过敏只要不靠太近就没事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000141:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0f825f9291f02daf31646eee55391ad99ad94d6ba1464c452a0f04de9a3e898",
      "text": "似乎是今天的彩排累坏了。\n喵子吃完饭之后，\n马上就睡着了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000143:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:487ea5da28cc429a6f1e90df607e4468998418d747927f6393ede98c0859b6f3",
      "text": "照这样看来，应该会一觉睡到明早吧。\n睡觉的距离也隔得开，\n用不着担心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64b327424d1ebde8532fcfd3c98f9af505ed920aeee1c96987f2b348b98edaee",
      "text": "我们做完最后确认之后，\n也要好好休息备战明天了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000147:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94313fde0768e54e657d4d3482eb457ab115c6e5f519da108d5d97d602c5677a",
      "text": "明天看起来会比今天还要忙碌啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_h:cmd-000149:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495ce61b648a903ba933f1bbeef77b710e37c408c7a966448d44512a94788c66",
      "text": "番长，明天也请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2440bbb452b244a19e278acda270d28f24b130abe569cb5e7ec3273eb8f972a6",
      "text": "神速一魂的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08164129593f0a4440ac8d5c1cf99d405c809771a1abb0fe51c2e452b990b4f4",
      "text": "起初虽然被震慑住了，\n不过今天的彩排还是圆满结束了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa3caca1ef19afdc4abb05de43d40538ae361b9ab540ff43f7c0b4edb29cd7c",
      "text": "照这个势头让明天的舞台也大获成功的话，\n离匡正世间恶人这个梦想肯定也能更进一步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b7cfb4f24ac3cfe10ecd3b1eb6345fdd2566b89e01343336c47efacad2da5e",
      "text": "是啊。……真怀念啊，被●●●●プロデューサー\n招募的那一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da26e0541718f49265074579a7ccad03f939de80e02d69f260f8b6a4e94531a4",
      "text": "那个时候，说实话对偶像这种东西\n还不太理解呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6e05807baebe2e3540730f6f463bc78e23c0e5b666b16e5539787aefea44bc",
      "text": "确实，那天朱雀说的话，\n我至今都还记得。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ffc7602376134ffb091091a999c3664fac3b05e2eb9456697d2c0d33f9609f0",
      "text": "为了从世上铲除邪恶，要成为偶像！\n……听到那个时，我也着实吃了一惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6801cf8128ab072e71839411c5216a6ca5cc4414d5f798444ae63f9997cdfeb5",
      "text": "但与此同时，我也觉得交给你\n说不定真能做成。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b1a3b28989e847db8796c2ce6e68284939bd78a97738c4372da90ce475a6ca1",
      "text": "……我们明天就要站上那个庞大的舞台，点燃观众的热情，\n给全世界的恶徒一记凶狠的瞪视。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af9b80453e5419259b26ff3b5f02379843567b1eb9c11e3bd3396688bed4b12f",
      "text": "他们一定会吓得瑟瑟发抖、停止作恶吧。\n言出必行……不愧是朱雀，不愧是我认可的搭档。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a56d0cabccb2d100f7ca7905e3e2ca509e98064deb4488b479495dbf6ca3ca7",
      "text": "玄武……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cee173521e0775ac81e3d093188538f118096e92566d2c043b80a42e247739af",
      "text": "能走到今天这一步，不单是我一个人的力量。\n是因为有你在啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0d4265d505540fb717b32c6d3e37edac5cb0771ce62ced773caf26300f62f2a",
      "text": "话说回来，我还没好好道过谢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff28fe0c99fd29c1026721f4c9c9219e44b12e8598706f66e34f5e1bfb36082",
      "text": "虽然现在才说有点迟，但愿意跟我一起成为偶像……\n谢谢你，玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef95112a427769e6b51825b09baa3e70aa59805ab5c0f3185df0d38b322e7bc",
      "text": "我也该向你道谢。能和你这样的汉子\n一起做偶像，我感到很自豪。朱雀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea3511d8f62dda239de0f8fdaf21059e4cc991ec07b0cc9854b2114c5db38dfd",
      "text": "……喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b03707b066324217090074e51c48f1bf01c5c20dd42a55d9c1cfab90cf27d3d8",
      "text": "好痛！抱歉啊喵子。\n吵醒你了不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1614c50748aba4486fe7dd9da7d4a42083fe1411d319adde352c27cc29e0b08a",
      "text": "哎呀朱雀，快把喵子抱住。\n再靠过来一点我喷嚏就要停不下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:304bee9b4b62549f729eeacf3bba6159865a8143b9e922e29f7efe44e804d937",
      "text": "我知道啦。\n来，喵子的床在这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71d1bf1cc24fd67e7b6abfba83f7ca39efc569754f1158ca62e845ce107f5b22",
      "text": "好了，既然都被喵子嫌吵挨训了，\n我们也差不多该睡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3932f71d827fc4a3b8ac5c323b8bbee77686b76f93bf5092baa2bdac970f60cb",
      "text": "噢，也是呢。\n……明天我们315 Pro可是第一个打头阵出场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc2c03e8cb0b8aec5edc15e105e7e1f50cd0f891f10c9dd5db690922c7ff8d9f",
      "text": "就由我们，让全场、让业界、\n不，让全世界都大吃一惊吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab4ff24204e5bd66c3882ce1419454e8fb8b611b5593d241b7bebac57a5bf94",
      "text": "言行一致。凭我们神速一魂，绝对办得到！\n去闹个天翻地覆吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
